{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2022-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1669852800, "end_date": 1672531199, "month_true_total": 19, "quota": 19, "returned": 19, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "129777148", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079754207", "personaname": "The Ayexeyen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079754207/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 2626, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1103, "last_played": 1673215792, "avatar": "caa1127a30ae3f7782a1136eb5a284beedd21bc4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was waiting for ME3 for YEARS in steam and finally it arrived after EA changed its mind.  I am playing it in 2022 and even if it's a 10 years old game it is still amazing.  I love the story, I love the dialogues, I love the combat.  It's an amazing game.", "timestamp_created": 1672494142, "timestamp_updated": 1672494142, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129728446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025325503", "personaname": "Rivale", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rivale/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 1929, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1929, "last_played": 1608061536, "avatar": "322f8bb04971fe8c7b1cfd61264978f63e7be3b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "After the changes to its end, fantastic. Go for the trilogy. I loved my journey with the crew. Every single minute of it.", "timestamp_created": 1672440572, "timestamp_updated": 1672440572, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129567720", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140215971", "personaname": "FinalCrutches04", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/finalcrutches04/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 5339, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2822, "last_played": 1730867587, "avatar": "9259650c7d85509f53b4ef19b5658a187a34c885"}, "language": "english", "review": "I don't think I ever went through a series of games this quickly or was so invested in a story as I was with the Mass Effect trilogy. The characters, the relationships, the romance, as well as the action and the stakes involved, made the experience more memorable. Hands down, this is greatest game series I ever played and I'm happy my friend recommended this to me.", "timestamp_created": 1672281032, "timestamp_updated": 1672281032, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129489502", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973811733", "personaname": "Aya", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flashn00b/", "num_games_owned": 620, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 38, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 38, "last_played": 1672188241, "avatar": "1daeca95c0db3777b2c76bde57f4b6518a2f92cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "While this game's definitely within \"wait for a sale\" territory considering that the singleplayer-only Legendary Edition exists for this game, I think it's still worth getting ME3 2012 for the multiplayer. However, DLC is handled by the EA client which will probably lead to complications that'll likely end with EA's support staff revoking your Steam copy and replacing it with an EA App version of the game.", "timestamp_created": 1672203757, "timestamp_updated": 1672203757, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.442864537239074707", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129378846", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987332666", "personaname": "Chill02", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chill02/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 255, "playtime_forever": 69, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 69, "last_played": 1671070636, "avatar": "1455a8864b70424927b8574be05e1660a62ac761"}, "language": "english", "review": "The only reason to get this version is if you're interested in playing the surprisingly solid multiplayer mode, which is still active as of this writing. You can get the DLC packs through Origin for free so there's no need to buy the bundle here.\n\nIf you're only interested in the campaign you're better off playing it in the Legendary Edition.", "timestamp_created": 1672097470, "timestamp_updated": 1672097470, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 34, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.784883379936218262", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 3}]}, {"recommendationid": "129279924", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994728091", "personaname": "Plutie", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Plutie_/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 200, "playtime_forever": 803, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1776446245, "avatar": "b61eaf9f415136fb682ebff69063a37fa35c3414"}, "language": "english", "review": "you can buy the game on steam, hopefully for sale, and get all the dlc for FREE on origin, dont use the ♥♥♥♥♥♥ new EA launcher it breaks the game. i purely bought this game again just to play the multiplayer since that ♥♥♥♥ is timeless and honest to god the best part of the game hands down. reminder, DO NOT buy the 30 dollar dlc pack through steam, its a rip off and is 100% free on origin.", "timestamp_created": 1672001697, "timestamp_updated": 1672001697, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540145933628082275", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129006764", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084047091", "personaname": "AbatedFawn", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AbatedFawn/", "num_games_owned": 1204, "num_reviews": 261, "playtime_forever": 64, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 64, "last_played": 1602366095, "avatar": "24eb02e62c351b60c301f7590b06b0e6d64f544e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This version has multiplayer, however just get the legendary edition.\n\nI love you ME3", "timestamp_created": 1671687066, "timestamp_updated": 1671687066, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128860323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198376809656",