: "0.508184969425201416", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128275631", "author": {"steamid": "76561198955009110", "personaname": "bobbysteel00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198955009110/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1404, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1401, "last_played": 1670659917, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everything", "timestamp_created": 1670658711, "timestamp_updated": 1670658711, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473174393177032471", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128064661", "author": {"steamid": "76561198308399326", "personaname": "SkullCrush3r114", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198308399326/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 814, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 422, "last_played": 1784443288, "avatar": "5eaa26819db04a04cca624de73ec0b89f1569c33"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm doing a positive review but this is more of a mixed review.\n\nThe game itself is great and the trilogy as a whole is always a must play from me. The multiplayer is still great, playable and holds up really well to this day. While modding on LE is probably better at this point modding still is relatively easy to do which makes the game even better.\n\nMy main issue isn't with the game itself but the same old EA app issues. Sometimes the game won't launch for me or I get a licenesing issue screen which then involves troubleshooting to fix. Most times it usually involves deleting a specific file for it to then get reaquired on launch. If not that the in game overlay for the EA app sometimes won't let the game run either so have to disable it.\n\nOtherwise the game is great, litterally just EA", "timestamp_created": 1670360972, "timestamp_updated": 1783273752, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.587556958198547363", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128029709", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080321783", "personaname": "jano", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/skibidijano/", "num_games_owned": 289, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 45, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 45, "last_played": 1670275404, "avatar": "09a9568ac960a3cbda8c5c651c9bb77c67028bee"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't input full hd resolution (it might be just me but still annoying) + controls can give you cancer. You can jump and crouch only if game lets you (for example jumping on objects or crouching behind the cover, you can't do it by yourself and whenever you want).  And most annoying thing about movement: jumping, crouching, sprinting and action key is the same one (spacebar in default), you can't seperate it.", "timestamp_created": 1670321494, "timestamp_updated": 1670443598, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478981196880340576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "127955137", "author": {"steamid": "765611980